        {
          "text": "The configuration requires order_of_interleaved_layers='local_attn_first'. For one-based layer number n, n modulo sliding_window_pattern selects a local window unless the remainder is zero; those periodic layers receive -1 and no RoPE. Pattern defaults to 1, therefore selecting all global layers, while sliding_window defaults to -1. The parent contains a different configuration spelling, sliding_window_size, in Gemma2; Cohere2 explicitly reads sliding_window.",
