        },
        {
          "text": "Attention initializes self.rope to None and clears it on unload. Loading now constructs RoPE only when settings are present; SDPA, uncached Flash Attention and cached Flash Attention each guard the rotation call. The Flash paths continue passing the layer's window to their respective kernels, and the cached path still retrieves and updates its KV cache. Disabling RoPE does not disable causality or caching.",
