          "evidence": ["call_c15fad2552ba4b42a263fed4d4ba37c1", "call_5d36bfad81554b8aa651673115505016", "call_0dc4d904b4bf45008e023c2e84ae454b", "call_ba7d81e1302b452d84ced56cd4f795a2", "call_5eb7063d3ca641e8a6142188c0feec96"]
        },
        {
          "text": "CohereLabs/c4ai-command-a-03-2025 declares 64 layers, hidden width 12288, intermediate width 36864 and 96 query/8 KV heads. CohereLabs/c4ai-command-r7b-12-2024 and CohereLabs/c4ai-command-r7b-arabic-02-2025 each declare 32 layers, hidden width 4096, intermediate width 14336 and 32 query/8 KV heads. All three match the registered architecture and required ordering, explicitly provide head_dim=128, sliding_window=4096 and pattern=4, and select SiLU.",
